902	  /**
903	   * Check if cache is dirty and if is dirty clear the context.
904	   * This check has a big side effect, it changes the underlying cache canvas if necessary.
905	   * Do not call this method on your own to check if the cache is dirty, because if it is,
906	   * it is also going to wipe the cache. This is badly designed and needs to be fixed.
907	   * @param {Boolean} skipCanvas skip canvas checks because this object is painted
908	   * on parent canvas.
